{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d9fdb0e3e5b1aadf","name":"Magnetic Hands","source":{"id":"source:reference-d9fdb0e3e5b1aadf","title":"Magnetic Hands","revision":21067,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:06:11Z","sha256":"f311d5e6f5174718b7ffe8959e6dd0ac52f43a6e9f2405dd9e1780263e702923","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21067","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Magnetic%20Hands&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d9fdb0e3e5b1aadf","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," Appendage Cost x 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," (2 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},") Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Magnetic Feet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Magnetic_Feet","referenceId":"reference:16c326e31f21c93f"}," are a common means of locomotion. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," specializing in extra-vehicular activities are often equipped with them. Magnetic Hands function like ",{"tag":"a","children":["Magnetic Feet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Magnetic_Feet","referenceId":"reference:16c326e31f21c93f"},". When used in concert with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Magnetic Feet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Magnetic_Feet","referenceId":"reference:16c326e31f21c93f"},", they provide a +2 bonus to any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Climb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Climb","referenceId":"reference:98ca5f27d9642dc7"}," checks made while maneuvering around a hull in space, as well as a +5 bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"}," against any attempt to knock the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," off the hull. When Magnetic Hands are activated, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," cannot make attacks or use anything requiring its hands, including weapons.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
